 "readTime": 2,
 "summary": "Setting up the Equinox 800 for beach metal detecting",
 "cover": "blog/files/PB280315_alliron.jpg",
 "heroVideo": null,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/youtube-header_website_enug23by.jpg\" alt=\"Beach metal detecting paul cee\" title=\"crawfords metal detecting uk discount\" width=\"394\" height=\"84\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/detexpert-logosml_0uu4x349.png\" alt=\"crawfords metal detectors\" title=\"paul cee minelab \" width=\"56\" height=\"83\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "h2",
   "html": "Beach settings for the Minelab Equinox 800 50 Tones"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/PB280315.jpg\" alt=\"Beach Settings1\" title=\"Equinox beach settings\" width=\"121\" height=\"215\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Initial turning on you have the Basic Detect screen"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/PB280315_alliron.jpg\" alt=\"deep nox settings\" title=\"Equinox beach settings\" width=\"120\" height=\"213\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Press the HORSE SHOE Button to select ALL METAL MODE"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/PB280315_selectmode.jpg\" alt=\"paul cee settings\" title=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" width=\"121\" height=\"215\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Press the DETECT button to select BEACH 1"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/PB280315_function.jpg\" alt=\"equinox detect screen\" title=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" width=\"120\" height=\"213\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Press the FUNCTION Button to Select Noise Cancel"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/PB280317_nywhvgky.jpg\" alt=\"nox screen\" title=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" width=\"108\" height=\"192\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Press The Accept Reject Button to confirm noise canel <img src=\"@img:images/PB280317_select.jpg\" alt=\"Equinox settings\" title=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" width=\"109\" height=\"193\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/PB280318.jpg\" alt=\"setting up equinox\" title=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" width=\"111\" height=\"198\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "h3",
   "html": "Press Again the FUNCTION BUTTON for Ground Balance",
   "inferred": true
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Use the PLUS &amp; Minus Buttons while SLOWLY Pumping the Coil above ground with targets beneath the coil!!! use the plus and minus buttons to adjust <img src=\"@img:images/PB280318_gb.jpg\" alt=\"setting equinox sensitivity\" title=\"equinox sensitivity\" width=\"91\" height=\"162\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "or Select the plus minus button for GROUND TRACKING"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/PB280319.jpg\" alt=\"tone adjust\" title=\"minelab equinox 800 tones\" width=\"100\" height=\"178\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Next is VOLUME ADJUST for 50 Tones( I USE MAX VOLUME FOR MAIN TONES)"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/PB280317.jpg\" alt=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" title=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" width=\"111\" height=\"197\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "PRESS AND HOLD FUNCTION BUTTON to access 2nd screen mode <img src=\"@img:images/PB280315_function_unnua97i.jpg\" alt=\"nox function button\" title=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" width=\"111\" height=\"198\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/PB280320.jpg\" alt=\"tone settings\" title=\"equinox tones\" width=\"101\" height=\"180\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Tone 1 Volume (IRON) is set to 16 to allow quiet hearing of the non ferous tone"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/PB280322.jpg\" alt=\"equinox 50 tones\" title=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" width=\"101\" height=\"180\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Tone 2 is set at 25"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Press the FUNCTION BUTTON Again to access the SIGNAL TONES Function"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/PB280332.jpg\" alt=\"equinox tone volume\" title=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" width=\"99\" height=\"176\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Set The desired TONE. THEN PRESS THE PLUS/MINUS BUTTON to access tones 2<img src=\"@img:images/PB280332_A.jpg\" alt=\"setting for tones\" title=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" width=\"94\" height=\"167\"> Tone 2 selection is now available select the desired tone <img src=\"@img:images/PB280331.jpg\" alt=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" title=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" width=\"86\" height=\"153\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Press the FUNCTION BUTTON To Access RECOVERY SPEED and IRON BIAS SETTING"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/PB280329_A.jpg\" alt=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" title=\"minelab Equinox 800 beach settings\" width=\"101\" height=\"180\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "I use RECOVERY SPEED of 4 as the beaches have deep iron but with a slow swing speed this is the best setting i have found.."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Press and hold the FUNCTION BUTTON to access the IRON BIAS setting.."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "(This is the Setting there is so much debate about whether it is set at zero or higher)"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/PB280328.jpg\" alt=\"Equinox iron bias\" title=\"Iron Bias\" width=\"109\" height=\"194\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "I personally use this set at 3"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Press the DETECT/PINPOINT button to return to the main Detect SCREEN <img src=\"@img:images/PB280316_A.jpg\" alt=\"equinox pinpoint button\" title=\"minelab equinox pinpoint\" width=\"96\" height=\"171\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Finally set the Sensitivity to suit.. some people tend to run The EQUINOX VERY HOT (high sensitivity) and if you are just learning the detector this will seriously frustrate you as it is very noisy, adjust using the PLUS/Minus buttons <img src=\"@img:images/PB280318_gb_02em57go.jpg\" alt=\"equinox 800 sensitivity\" title=\"minelab equinox sensitivity\" width=\"75\" height=\"133\"> usually between 19 and 24 i have found to be the most stable but as beach conditions can vary greatly from beach to beach then so can this value.."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "These are the settings i have tuned over the months using the STOCK COIL."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Setting for the 15\" coil still in testing but i will update when i have good stable results"
  }
 ],
